{"title": "iostat 观察写入负载", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "dd if=/dev/zero of=/dev/loop0 bs=1M oflag=direct &"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "iostat -d /dev/loop0 1 3 | awk '{print $1,$2,$4}'"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "Device tps kB_wrtn/s"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "loop0 3000.00 1536000.00"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "持续直写时 tps 3000、写吞吐 1.5 GB/s（loop 盘上限）"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "改完参数用它对比前后吞吐。实测环境：Rocky 9.3 容器 sysstat 12.5.4"}
]}
